% Lesson 15, exercise 7: an undefined answer with two conditions.
% From a, either move leads to a position that can only move back, so
% win(a) waits on win(b) and on win(c), and they each wait on win(a).
% Loaded and checked by ExerciseTests.
%
%   python3 slg.py exercises/15-answers.dl -q 'win(a)'

move(a, b).
move(a, c).
move(b, a).
move(c, a).

win(X) :- move(X, Y), not win(Y).
